#, no-wrap
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "プライバシー"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/privacy/index.md
msgid "At CoMaps, we respect your privacy. CoMaps does not have any form of identification of people, advertising, or personal data collection."
msgstr "CoMapsでは、あなたのプライバシーを尊重します。CoMapsは、個人を特定できる情報、広告、個人データの収集を一切行いません。"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/privacy/index.md
msgid "CoMaps does not track you."
msgstr "CoMapsはあなたを追跡しません。"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/privacy/index.md content/terms/index.md
msgid "If you have any questions or suggestions, please contact us at legal@comaps.app"
msgstr "質問や提案がある場合は、法務用メールアドレス legal@comaps.app までご連絡ください"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/privacy/index.md
msgid "Policy effective: 2025-05-01"
msgstr "ポリシーの有効化日: 2025-05-01"

